|  Help
|
|  Commands
|  /agents  Browse this session's subagents, view one, or stop a continuable child
|  /btw  Ask a side question in a temporary Agent session
|  /changelog  Show the release changelog (what's new)
|  /compact  Compact older conversation history
|  /context  Show token usage and the context window
|  /copy  Copy the last assistant message to the clipboard
|  /effort (/thinking)  Switch the thinking effort of the current model
|  /feedback  Record feedback about this session
|  /files  Browse files delivered by the agent
|  /fork  Fork the current session into a new one
|  /goal  Set or view the goal for a long-running task
|  /help  Show available commands and key bindings
|  /init  Analyze the codebase and write AGENTS.md
|  /jobs  Browse background jobs
|  /mcp  List the MCP servers the host connects to
|
|  ↑/↓ scroll · Ctrl+E expand · Esc back
